WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.750
Make room for your day with RingCal.

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.210
A calm calendar for the things you want to remember.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.970
Choose a day and time.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:13.030
Add a title and notes, so the details are there when you need them.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.915
Make reminders repeat daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly.

00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:20.650
Complete one occurrence and keep the next.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.160
Choose an alarm sound you'll recognize.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.220
Preview built-in sounds, Android tones, or your own audio.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.505
Your reminders stay on your device.

00:00:31.665 --> 00:00:34.390
No sign-in, ads, or analytics.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.450
RingCal. Your calendar. Your reminders.
